docs {
  # Pengabdian (Usulan Pengabdian) API
  
  Endpoints untuk manajemen usulan pengabdian kepada masyarakat.
  
  ## Base URL
  `/api/pengabdian`

  ## Alias URL (Compatibility)
  `/api/usulan-pengabdian`
  
  ## Endpoints Overview
  
  | Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role | Description |
  |--------|----------|------|------|-------------|
  | GET | /landing | ❌ | Public | Konten landing pengabdian |
  | GET | / | ✅ | All | List usulan pengabdian user |
  | GET | /options | ✅ | All | Dropdown options untuk form |
  | GET | /by-prodi | ✅ | Koordinator | List usulan berdasarkan prodi |
  | GET | /search | ✅ | All | Cari usulan pengabdian |
  | GET | /:id | ✅ | All | Detail usulan pengabdian |
  | POST | / | ✅ | Dosen/Mahasiswa | Buat usulan pengabdian |
  | PUT | /:id | ✅ | Dosen/Mahasiswa | Update usulan (Draft only) |
  | POST | /:id/submit | ✅ | Dosen/Mahasiswa | Submit usulan |
  | POST | /:id/forward | ✅ | Koordinator | Forward usulan + lampiran |
  | DELETE | /:id | ✅ | Dosen/Mahasiswa | Hapus usulan (Draft only) |
  
  ## Status Usulan
  - `Draft` - Belum disubmit
  - `Pending` - Menunggu review
  - `Disetujui` - Approved
  - `Ditolak` - Rejected
  - `Revisi` - Perlu revisi
}
